            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in Sonault 1.9.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Send us feedback right from the app</strong> — the new speech-bubble button at the bottom of the sidebar opens a quick feedback form. Your message reaches us instantly, tied to your account, no email required.</li>
  <li>Fixed a small ghost square that could flash over the splash and sign-in screens on some Macs.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
